From: rx1950-linux maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Link Xrender explicitly in cairo mode

matchbox-keyboard-image.c calls XRenderFindStandardFormat and
XRenderCreatePicture regardless of the drawing backend.  The Xft backend
pulled libXrender in indirectly, but the cairo backend does not, causing a
link failure with modern linkers.

Signed-off-by: rx1950-linux maintainers
---
 src/Makefile.am | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/Makefile.am b/src/Makefile.am
index 069579c..e25b386 100644
--- a/src/Makefile.am
+++ b/src/Makefile.am
@@ -17,5 +17,5 @@
 bin_PROGRAMS = matchbox-keyboard
 
-matchbox_keyboard_LDADD = $(FAKEKEY_LIBS) $(XFT_LIBS) $(EXPAT_LIBS) $(CAIRO_LIBS) $(PNG_LIBS)
+matchbox_keyboard_LDADD = $(FAKEKEY_LIBS) $(XFT_LIBS) $(EXPAT_LIBS) $(CAIRO_LIBS) $(PNG_LIBS) -lXrender
 
 matchbox_keyboard_SOURCES =                                          \
-- 
2.47.0
